that is. Sorry. What's that?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> [DA V20] p.281 - This is a necromancy path created to study life and death through corpses. Path apply some aspects of the corpse to necromancer (or other vampire). It is available only to Cappadocians (and Harbingers of Skulls)<br /> This path is written in the V20.<br /> <br /> Benedictio Vitae: Level 5<br /> <br /> Player spend 12 BP (also, you can spend 1BP and drink 3... In most cases, it will be the death of a mortal).<br /> <br /> Necromancer can travel in daylight, also vampire largely immune to the scorching effects of the sun, Fortitude difficulties to soak damage from direct sunlight are halved, and necromancer takes no damage if kindred is sufficiently covered (hooded cloak) or in shade.<br /> <br /> Necromancer can experience and enjoy many of the fine things about human life (warmth of sun, food, drink, embracing of lover). The vampire is no more vulnerable to fire than mortal. (Rules did not have accurate information about fire)<br /> <br /> Vampire will not slumber during day and remain active during the day without Humanity or Path-based dice pool caps.<br /> <br /> Stake or Holy Artefact are still dangerous. Difficulty of Frenzy and Rotschreck are halved (rounded up). Power last until nex midnight after casting.<br /> But, after Benedictio Vitae expire, difficulty of all rolls to resist frenzy and rotschreck increases by 3 for next 6 nights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25408,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","user":"Alphari","date":". 05-13-2020, 08:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25408-alphari","name":"Alphari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25408_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"153"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T23:07:59-07:00","id":1388241,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I had something of a one shot &quot;sort of&quot; hunter (more like hunters who were a mix of magical warriors and a werewolf) game where a few vampires (in a college) had this sunblock and I never seriously thought about the wider world of vampires. It was more like the WoD equivalent of an action movie","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}